                <pb facs="1077" n="953" sameAs="frus:frus1881/pg953"/>

                <head>No. 581.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Blaine to Mr. Hurlbut.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1881-11-26"><hi rendition="#italic">November</hi> 26,
                        1881</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hurlbut</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Minister, Lima:</hi></p>
                <p>Special envoy extraordinary leaves Washington for Peru immediately. Continue
                    recognition of Calderon government.</p>
                <closer><signed>BLAINE.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
